{
  "name": "stepwise-small-model-coding-edit-verify-revert",
  "description": "The inner loop for an already locked plan: apply one edit, run the verify card with honest exit codes, read the error per stack, keep or revert to the git-index checkpoint, guard test integrity, decide next, retry or stop, and report with evidence.",
